# Layer structure

| Project | Responsibility |
|---------|----------------|
| `Pilldue.Business` | Domain types, ports, planning rules, app services, in-memory fakes |
| `Pilldue.Data` | `PilldueDbContext`, EF mapping, migrations, SQLite paths, config file, `PilldueComposition` |
| `Pilldue.UI` | Spectre screens. Calls `IPilldueApp` and other Business types only |
| `Pilldue.App` | Terminal composition root. Opens SQLite and migrates |
| `Pilldue.UI.Desktop` | WPF composition root. Same Business services as the terminal host |

**Direction**

- UI → Business. UI does not reference Data, EF, SQLite, or SQL.
- Data → Business. Data implements ports. Business does not reference EF or `Pilldue.Data`.
- Hosts (`Pilldue.App`, `Pilldue.UI.Desktop`) may reference Data to compose the app.
- Refill math stays in Business (`RefillCalendarRules` and planning types). Do not reimplement it in UI or Data.
